SUMMARY:Special Event: Richie O’Farrill EN ESPAÑOL (THIS SHOW IS COMPLET
 ELY IN SPANISH WITH NO TRANSLATION)
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 3070 Windward Plaza\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:Hay conversaciones que la mayoría evita.  Ricardo O’Farrill
   decidió hacer un show entero sobre ellas. Con su característico humor 
 ácido\, aborda temas incómodos\, contradicciones humanas y preguntas que 
 suelen quedarse sin respuesta. Un espectáculo para quienes disfrutan reír
 se de lo que normalmente se toma demasiado en serio.\n\nCouple's Package in
 cludes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)
 \n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nThere is a two-item per person minimum
  in the Showroom\, which can be fulfilled with any food or drink items from
  the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food and drinks purchased in the bar and lounge 
 do not count towards the two-item minimum.\n\nManagement reserves the right
  to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive o
 r dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-at
 las/event/special-event-richie-ofarrill-en-espanol-this-show-is-completely-
